  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The net torque on the system (rod+bullet) will be zero about hinge point. Therefore, we can apply the principle of angular momentum conservation about hinge point.</p><p>From angular momentum conservation,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>m</mi><msup><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>m</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>&#969;</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#969;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>v</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>v</mi></mrow><mfenced><mrow><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><msup><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mfrac></math></p><p>For maximum angular velocity,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi>&#969;</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><msup><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>L</mi><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>&#969;</mi><mi>max</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>v</mi></mrow><mfenced><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><msup><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mi>L</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi>L</mi></mstyle></mfenced></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>L</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p>",
    "image": null
